  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "The children sit down to eat, and they look happy. A tray holds their food, and a paper bag stands beside it. One child holds a round burger above its wrapper. Under the soft burger bun, we can see cheese and fresh lettuce. The other child opens a food box of chicken nuggets. The child dips chicken nuggets into the dipping sauce. A full box of French fries has ketchup beside it. One cup has a straw, and a lid rests on the table beside another cup. The adult drinks through a straw. A fork and a spoon lie beside a clean napkin. The children enjoy their meal together.",
    "textZh": "小朋友坐下吃東西，看起來很開心。托盤盛著他們的餐點，旁邊立著一個紙袋。一位小朋友拿著圓形漢堡，食物包裝紙在下面。在柔軟的漢堡麵包下面，我們可以看見起司和新鮮的生菜。另一位小朋友打開裝著雞塊的餐盒。這位小朋友把雞塊沾進沾醬。一盒裝滿的薯條旁邊放著番茄醬。一個杯子裡插著吸管，另一個杯子旁的桌上放著杯蓋。大人用吸管喝飲料。叉子和湯匙放在一張乾淨的餐巾紙旁邊。小朋友一起享用餐點。",
